{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd5a\u00a0<strong>Buy various chickens and get surprise eggs</strong><br>Feed your chickens and collect different surprise eggs!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/892a609395d9bdefe0f5dc93f0dfb1de.poster.avif?t=1771246837\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/892a609395d9bdefe0f5dc93f0dfb1de.webm?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/892a609395d9bdefe0f5dc93f0dfb1de.mp4?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81\u00a0<strong>Open the eggs and complete your collection</strong><br>Open surprise eggs and combine the pieces to expand your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/d98b06e43251c4c67d125defc91dfb40.poster.avif?t=1771246837\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/d98b06e43251c4c67d125defc91dfb40.webm?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/d98b06e43251c4c67d125defc91dfb40.mp4?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83d\uded2\u00a0<strong>Place the eggs on the shelves and sell them</strong><br>Fill the shelves of your store, sell to customers, and increase your earnings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/4f85b37b7da7efddf34f6eb1cf603e73.poster.avif?t=1771246837\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/4f85b37b7da7efddf34f6eb1cf603e73.webm?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/4f85b37b7da7efddf34f6eb1cf603e73.mp4?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83e\udde9\u00a0<strong>Combine the pieces and unlock toys</strong><br>Complete the collected pieces to create a variety of unique toys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/f233fb80a3ca9166107a6e47cbcb4a5a.poster.avif?t=1771246837\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/f233fb80a3ca9166107a6e47cbcb4a5a.webm?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/f233fb80a3ca9166107a6e47cbcb4a5a.mp4?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83e\uddf8\u00a0<strong>Showcase and sell your toys</strong><br>Display your collection on the store\u2019s wall shelves, shine with rare toys, and make sales!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/cafd7649f52b401f52c75bc5a862be76.poster.avif?t=1771246837\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/cafd7649f52b401f52c75bc5a862be76.webm?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/cafd7649f52b401f52c75bc5a862be76.mp4?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83d\udcc8\u00a0<strong>Expand and grow your store</strong><br>Use your earnings to expand your store, unlock new areas, sell more products, and keep your customers happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/60f72cb25a7719b9fb1a5dbeeffa6be3.poster.avif?t=1771246837\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/60f72cb25a7719b9fb1a5dbeeffa6be3.webm?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/extras/60f72cb25a7719b9fb1a5dbeeffa6be3.mp4?t=1771246837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udc49\u00a0<i>Super Egg Simulator</i>\u00a0will show you the thrill of opening surprise eggs and the fun of running your very own store. Set your strategy, grow step by step, and become the owner of the most popular toy store in town!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972970?t=1771246837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/13cc87d175d5edd1b13130580b88cf82729ced5f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771246837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/157cfd2cc5153c54f3daf64ba11a8a66ca1a85d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771246837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972970/157cfd2cc5153c54f3daf64ba11a8a66ca1a85d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771246837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd5a\u00a0<stro